uuluva hyönteislaji. Sitä tavataan Suomessa kesäkuusta syyskuuhun. Sokkopaarmat elävät kosteissa metsissä, niityillä, soilla sekä vesistöillä. Sokkopaarmanaaraat saalistavat ihmisverta sen sisältämän valkuaisaineen vuoksi. Ne tarvitsevat valkuaista kehittääkseen munansa. Munat munitaan kasvistoon lähelle veden pintaa. Lajin koiraat imevät kukkien mettä. Sokkopaarman pituus on 8–12 millimetriä.","spread":16388,"m":[0,0,0,0,0,2,3,0,0,0,0,0],"s":[[60.28271,19.60115],[60.10183,19.82777],[60.03194,19.98243],[60.21249,20.21385]]},{"id":52480,"sci":"Volucella pellucens","fi":"Ampiaisvieras","group":"Insecta","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/412245914/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/412245914/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Christian Sørensen, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Christian Sørensen","wiki":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volucella_pellucens","summary":"","spread":16455,"m":[0,0,0,0,0,4,12,6,0,0,0,0],"s":[[60.11241,19.94462],[60.23194,20.22119],[60.23212,20.22127],[60.31179,19.94089],[60.09503,19.93894],[60.23662,19.81474],[60.36133,19.90761],[60.23294,19.81994],[60.24699,19.64037],[60.01193,20.41856]]},{"id":9195,"sci":"Emberiza citrinella","fi":"Keltasirkku","group":"Aves","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/500177041/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/500177041/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Diego González Dopico, some rights reserved (CC BY), uploaded by Diego González Dopico","wiki":"https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keltasirkku","summary":"<b>Keltasirkku</b> (<i>Emberiza citrinella</i>) on keltainen sirkkuihin kuuluva varpuslintu.","spread":16946,"m":[0,0,1,6,2,4,2,0,2,0,0,0],"s":[[60.31068,19.78251],[60.31199,19.93971],[60.13912,19.91261],[60.21811,19.53889],[60.07432,20.04616],[60.21905,19.70615],[60.19551,19.33914],[60.21236,20.23789]]},{"id":77780,"sci":"Linnaea borealis","fi":"Vanamo","group":"Plantae","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/297803408/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/297803408/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Li Jianong, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Li Jianong","wiki":"https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vanamo","summary":"<b>Vanamo</b> (<i>Linnaea borealis</i>) on pieni, ainavihanta varpu. Se on mahdollisesti vanamoiden (<i>Linnaea</i>) suvun ainoa laji. Aikaisemmin vanamo luokiteltiin kuuluvan kuusamakasveihin (Caprifoliaceae). Vanamo oli Carl von Linnén lempikasvi, joten hän antoi kasvin suvuksi omasta sukunimestään muokatun nimen. Lajinimi <i>borealis</i> merkitsee pohjoista.","spread":17070,"m":[0,0,0,0,0,15,0,1,0,1,0,0],"s":[[60.22455,19.54138],[60.06509,20.02555],[60.20661,19.60666],[60.2453,19.55704],[60.24829,19.55873],[60.24751,19.54833],[60.27784,20.21813],[60.2764,20.19601],[60.20186,20.04339]]},{"id":70128,"sci":"Sphinx pinastri","fi":"Mäntykiitäjä","group":"Insecta","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/203676691/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/203676691/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Michał Brzeziński, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Michał Brzeziński","wiki":"https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mäntykiitäjä","summary":"<b>Mäntykiitäjä</b> (<i>Sphinx pinastri</i>) on mustanharmaa männiköissä viihtyvä kiitäjälaji.","spread":17750,"m":[0,0,0,0,0,2,7,5,3,0,0,0],"s":[[60.21154,20.37158],[60.02002,20.59364],[60.29642,19.90851],[60.14217,20.23799]]},{"id":483448,"sci":"Tholera cespitis","fi":"Mustaeloyökkönen","group":"Insecta","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/224270271/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/224270271/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Michał Brzeziński, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Michał Brzeziński","wiki":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tholera_cespitis","summary":"","spread":1779